# Placeholder names only. dsh-superagent does not load this file.
# Copying it to .env does not configure DeepSeek Harness or any channel account.
# Put real tokens in the operator's own CLI config, outside this repository.
# See SECURITY.md and docs/006-deployment.md.

# Name of the cloud model provider the DSH profile should use. Not a secret.
# CONEST_MODEL_PROVIDER=

# Absolute path of a state directory outside this checkout. Not a secret.
# CONEST_STATE_DIR=
